# Explicit snapshot URIs for EVERY pocket — main, updates, AND security.
# mkosi's Apt.setup only generates sources when this file is absent, so this
# replaces its generated list, whose security pocket is hardcoded live. The
# deb822 Snapshot: field is no strict pin either — apt keeps the live repo
# active alongside the snapshot (#96) — so the URI itself is the pin, which
# also needs no apt snapshot support. Keep the timestamp in lockstep across
# this file's stanza; bump it deliberately (rolls the image measurement).
Types: deb deb-src
URIs: https://snapshot.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/20260430T000000Z
Suites: resolute resolute-updates resolute-security
Components: main universe
Signed-By: /usr/share/keyrings/ubuntu-archive-keyring.gpg
